6
00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.191
<i>A JEON Yun-su Film
Look at the control of contrast</i>

7
00:01:31.226 --> 00:01:33.284
Look at the control of contrast

8
00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:36.886
His techniques parallel
